@startuml SSD_UC10_RecordPostPublication
title SSD - UC10 Record a post-publication correction

hide footbox

actor ":Authorised Editor" as AE
participant ":Production Record System" as S

AE -> S : recordCorrection(publication, type, reason)
activate S
alt type = metadata correction
  S --> AE : metadata correction linked to the publication (GS35)
else type = new audio version
  S --> AE : new audio version linked to the publication\nand to a replacement Draft (GS36, A14)
end
deactivate S

note right of S
  Q6 stays open.
  The replacement Draft is not published here.
  If it is published later, UC8 reviews it first (A14).
end note
@enduml
